			},
			"date": "2026-09-01T22:34:38.000Z",
			"content": "<p>I have been working on a <a href=\"https://rmendes.net/categories/eleventy/\" class=\"p-category\">#Eleventy</a> 4 theme for <a href=\"https://rmendes.net/categories/indiekit/\" class=\"p-category\">#Indiekit</a> and yes I was pleasingly surprised to see it work out of the box with the current “eleventy-preset” core indiekit package (its supposed to be Eleventy 3.x.x) My inspiration was onbviously Zach Leatherman own <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/speedlify2/\">Eleventy 4 theme</a></p>",
